# M07 Gen2 tty1 login and Plasma/Wayland preflight

Capture date: 2026-09-24 17:44:38 UTC (guest `date -u` output)
Transport: existing configured SSH host `alp-m2-gen2` with `HostName=172.28.164.164`; guest user `sa`.
Scope: read-only. No new login, configuration change, service start, or Plasma launch was performed.

## tty1 PAM/logind evidence

Commands:

```sh
date -u
loginctl list-sessions --no-legend
loginctl show-session 27 -p User -p Name -p Seat -p TTY -p Remote -p Service -p Leader -p Type -p Active -p State
journalctl -b -o short-iso --no-pager | grep -E 'pam_unix\(login:session\): session opened for user admin|systemd-logind.*New session 27' | tail -n 5
```

